  "articleBody": "A garage-to-office conversion can create a comfortable, dedicated workspace, but the right scope depends on parking, ceiling height, insulation, daylight, electrical capacity, moisture control, and intended use. Before hiring, confirm feasibility, define whether the room remains non-habitable office space, and request a coordinated design, permit, construction, and inspection plan.",
